WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:06.000
News arrived from Qingzhou: Xie Xuan submitted a memorial confessing his incompetence, grieving that he had failed the imperial benevolence, and requesting the death penalty.

00:12.640 --> 00:16.440
I merely asked you to reform the laws of one province is it so difficult?

00:16.520 --> 00:21.440
Your servant is incompetent indeed, I lack the ability I am willing to accept death.

00:21.800 --> 00:26.920
Your servant is already a useless person should have followed my sister long ago.

00:27.000 --> 00:27.960
You.

